<Base title="Corrections">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">Corrections · The registry's own ledger</div>
      <h1>What we got <em>wrong</em>, and when.</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-lede">
        Every substantive change to a published case is logged here, in reverse chronological order. Typos and stylistic edits are not logged.
      </p>
    </div>
