    <h2>2026-05-20 · Actor-fact validation pass</h2>
    <p>A systematic review of every named actor, title, party affiliation, jurisdiction, <code>legal_status</code>, and <code>evidentiary_status</code> field across all 36 cases. 124 individual claims validated; 81.4% verified clean. Eighteen substantive fixes applied below.</p>

